    "aboutTheProgram": "About the program",
    "aboutTheProgramContent1": "Coke Fresh is ",
    "aboutTheProgramContent2": "a 6-month functional trainee program",
    "aboutTheProgramContent3": " designed to be a career launchpad for young talents to fizz up their passion and gain valuable applied experience in Coca-Cola corporate world. Our program also offer fertile soil for developing, sharpening their competitive skills (hard and soft skills) and making groundbreaking strides on their career!​\n\nAre you a driven, innovative Gen Z eager to ",
    "aboutTheProgramContent4": "make tangible impacts",
    "aboutTheProgramContent5": "? At Coca-Cola Beverages Vietnam (CCBV), we believe that each of you has a unique competitive edge and a fizzing passion that is ready to be uncapped! With that, Coke Fresh 2024 opens up ",
    "aboutTheProgramContent6": "diverse pathways",
    "aboutTheProgramContent7": " from Sales to Enabling functions, allowing you to align your career aspirations with your background and strengths, while immersing yourself in different facets of our business through practical experiences.​\n\nThis is your chance to expose to a variety of projects, ",
    "aboutTheProgramContent8": "upskill",
    "aboutTheProgramContent9": " with significant and unique experience, make your ",
    "aboutTheProgramContent10": "ambitions come alive",
    "aboutTheProgramContent11": ", and ",
    "aboutTheProgramContent12": "infuse a refreshing spark",
    "aboutTheProgramContent13": " into the future of both our organization and your career.\n​",
    "aboutTheProgramContent14": "Apply to Coke Fresh 2024 to FIZZ UP your passion!​​​",
    "usedEmail": "This email has already been used for another existing application. You should only apply once for the program.",
