    "jobOverview": "Job Overview",
    "keyRoleResponsibilities": "Key Role Responsibilities",
    "salesOverview": "Key Working Scope: Business development and market execution at the assigned territory sales area of General Trade (GT) channel;Working Location: at a city/province in one of our 7 sales regions nationwide as below",
    "salesResponsibilities": "Implement sales execution & promotional programs at designated district/territory​;Develop the customer network in the assigned sales channel, maintain good relationships with customers to achieve daily, weekly, and monthly sales growth​;Provide customer service, address customer inquiries, and follow up on customer orders​;Coordinate and collaborate with cross-functional teams to ensure operation excellence;Lead self and lead others to drive the optimal effectiveness of the market execution and maximize our growth through well-established KPIs.​",
    "tradeMarketingOverview": "Working Location: Head Office – Ho Chi Minh city​;Key Working Scope: Targeted Trade Marketing Execution;Job Summary: In this role, you will be tasked with handling a specific marketing workstream in our critical project to drive our success at points of sale and elevate our business growth. You will become a project team member and work with others to ensure the excellent execution of the project. With that, you'll immerse in the world of Trade Marketing, the FMCG industry, and hone your skills through our critical project.",
    "tradeMarketingResponsibilities": "You will be contributing to our peak season's marketing campaign across the Modern Trade and General Trade channels, ensuring we win at points of sale through excellent execution, including but not limited to:​;Execute marketing activities for assigned accounts, including coordinating and enhancing promotional programs.​;Contribute to volume and market share growth in designated areas by tapping into customer engagement, joint events, enhancing brand visibility, and building customer loyalty/engagement.​Align with cross-functional teams and customers to develop and implement activity plans, ensuring they meet the \"Picture of Success\".;Oversee the implementation of thematic promotions, ensuring they meet program objectives.​;Support the reporting and data analysis to drive better decision-making for winning at points of sale​",
    "rtmOverview": "Working Location: Head Office – Ho Chi Minh city;Key Working Scope: E-B2B Solution Enhancement​;Job Summary: In this role, you will participate in the upcoming operations of the e-Route-to-market (e-RTM) Project in Vietnam through hands-on execution. As technology moves forward, we look for a futuristic vision to offer additional value to our key customers/consumers and pragmatic yet robust enablers to support our sales and commercial figures. It is an in-house e-B2B Tool 1P with a newly operational process, integrating with the current traditional RTM Model.​",
    "rtmResponsibilities": "The role will support the upcoming operations of the e-RTM Project in Vietnam, including but not limited to:​;Assist the e-RTM operation team with organizing the project and tracking its progress, keeping visibility on its development and monitoring the results.​;Participate in the Business Case building for Vietnam​;Attend the Business Requirement Description for the Blueprint.​;Review the UI/UX Modules features with Agile Project Management.​;Follow the rollout with seamless operations every day.​",
    "onPremiseOverview": "Working Location: Head Office – Ho Chi Minh city​;Key Working Scope: Key Account (Modern Trade - On Premise*) execution excellence​;Job Summary: In this role, you will be tasked with planning & tracking to deploy the Pictures of Success for On Premise channel, including overseeing the in-store activities and ensuring proper activation execution in major on premise locations. With this, you will contribute to the enhancement of account partnership operation excellence.;(*) Our On-Premise channel refers to a variety of venue categories/accounts that operates immediate beverage consumption outlets (the product sold is meant to be consumed on the premises at which it is sold). This channel includes coffee shops, restaurants, movie theaters, etc.",
    "onPremiseResponsibilities": "Collaborate with the Marketing Team to deploy the \"Pictures of Success\" for assigned sub-channels.​;Act as the primary contact for synthesizing reports, tracking daily sales performance, managing shipments, and handling other related tasks.​;Provide daily tracking to improve our market execution score, ensuring optimal retail engagement and execution.​;Continuously improve channel execution by identifying and addressing any issues or opportunities for enhancement.​",
    "offPremiseOverview": "Working Location: Head Office – Ho Chi Minh city​;Key Working Scope: Key Account (Modern Trade - Off Premise*) execution excellence​;Job Summary: In this role, you will be contributing to the deployment of point-of-purchase communication strategies, overseeing the in-store activities and ensuring proper activation execution in major retail stores of the Off Premise channel. With this, you will together with us drive the enhancement of promotional effectiveness.​;(*) The Off-Premise channel refers to a variety of venue categories/accounts where the sold product is intended to be consumed at a location different from where the sale took place. This channel includes hypermarkets, supermarkets, convenience stores, and other similar retail establishments.​",
    "offPremiseResponsibilities": "Collaborate with the Marketing Team to deploy point-of-purchase (POP) communication strategies for our upcoming peak season in designated hypermarkets and supermarkets.​;Proactively follow up on in-store activities to ensure proper execution of activations and consumer promotions.​;Act as the primary contact for synthesizing reports, tracking daily sales performance, managing shipments, and handling other related tasks.​;Provide daily tracking to improve our market execution score, ensuring optimal retail engagement and execution.​;Monitor and track promotion compliance to ensure adherence to planned activities.​;Continuously improve POP execution by identifying and addressing any issues or opportunities for enhancement.​",
    "itPrivacyOverview": "Working Location:  Head Office – Ho Chi Minh city​;Key Working Scope: Data privacy & compliance enhancement​;Job Summary: This role will be contributing to our data privacy compliance and audit enhancement related to cybersecurity and IT audit. You will work closely with our IT and Legal teams to ensure our company adheres to legal standards and in-house policies.​",
    "itPrivacyResponsibilities": "Assist in the implementation of effective and sustainable data privacy and security policies.​;Support the team in conducting internal and external audits, maintaining records of data processing activities.​;Participate in training and awareness initiatives to foster a data protection culture within the organization.​;Assist in the management of data protection tasks such as Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIAs) and data breach notification procedures.​;Involve in the investigation of data privacy breaches and cooperate with supervisory authorities if necessary.​;Stay up-to-date with changes in data protection laws and regulations.​",
    "itDataOverview": "Working Location:  Head Office – Ho Chi Minh city​;Key Working Scope: Data Analytics Solutions​;Job Summary: This role will be contributing to data analytics and intelligence solutions, together with our IT team to implement effective tools to support the business with better insights and data-driven decision making​",
    "itDataResponsibilities": "Assist in the technical design of data analytics tools, such as data bricks, Margin Minder and PowerBI dashboards and reports data ingestion.​;Work closely with the data team to understand and transform data with the right architecture standards.​;Test and troubleshoot analytics solutions to ensure quality and accuracy.​;Document all development activity and work done.​;Participate in team meetings and contribute to knowledge sharing within the team.​",
    "procurementOverview": "Working Location:  Head Office – Ho Chi Minh city​;Key Working Scope: Optimal Purchasing Decision Making​;Job Summary: In this role, you will analyze the supply and demand, collaborating with stakeholders to develop effective programs/ methods for purchasing. With that, you are also tasked to ensure supply continuity and achieve inventory targets.​",
    "procurementResponsibilities": "Collaborate with suppliers to understand the supply base, lead times, and ensure reliable sourcing of assigned items or services (Indirect/ Direct)​;Work closely with the Planning team to align purchasing decisions with production requirements, coordinate with the Finance team to set inventory levels and targets if any.​;Develop and finalize concepts and calculations for reorder points for each item in collaboration with Planning and Finance​;Define precise data sources for stock on hand, in transit, and stock at converters​;Engage with the IT department to build and maintain a program that supports these purchasing and inventory management objectives​;Periodically execute and improve the program in collaboration with all stakeholders to ensure it remains effective and aligned with business goals.​",
    "careerNote1": "You should be able to work full-time in at least 6 months",
    "careerNote2": "You should be able to work almost full-time in at least 6 months, 1-3 shifts off per week for school are allowed. (1 shift = Half-day = A morning or an Afternoon)​",
    "cokeJourney": "The Coke  Fresh Journey"
